  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/IMG_2115.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(18 fotos) La tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles ha abierto su puertas en la calle Alzira, 32 de Onda Gesti&oacute;n Inmobiliaria vives, que ofrece venta y alquiler, administraci&oacute;n, locales comerciales o fincas. Su tel&eacute;fono es el 662 18 86 01 y el horario es de 10 13.30 horas y de 17 a 20 horas, de lunes a viernes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2092.jpg\" alt=\"img_2092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2093.jpg\" alt=\"img_2093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2095.jpg\" alt=\"img_2095\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2096.jpg\" alt=\"img_2096\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2100.jpg\" alt=\"img_2100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2102.jpg\" alt=\"img_2102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2105.jpg\" alt=\"img_2105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2106.jpg\" alt=\"img_2106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gestioimmobiliariavives/img_2107.jpg\" alt=\"img_2107\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig